Third-party material in this repository

- models/crnn_en.onnx: text_recognition_CRNN_EN_2021sep.onnx from the OpenCV Zoo
  (https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo), redistributed unchanged under that
  repository's license for the model.
- docs/icons/*.png: AWS Architecture Icons (https://aws.amazon.com/architecture/icons/),
  used in the architecture diagram as AWS permits for architecture diagrams.
- Camera frames and gauge data: public U.S. Geological Survey and NOAA/NWS data.
